#: mainwindow.cpp:629
msgid "Are you sure you want to turn on private browsing?"
msgstr "Ten certeza de querer activar a navegación privada?"

#: mainwindow.cpp:630
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>%1</b><p>When private browsing is turned on, web pages are not added to "
"the history, new cookies are not stored, current cookies cannot be accessed, "
"site icons will not be stored, the session will not be saved,  and searches "
"are not added to the pop-up menu in the Google search box.  Until you close "
"the window, you can still click the Back and Forward buttons to return to "
"the web pages you have opened.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>%1</b><p>Cando a navegación privada está activada, as páxinas web non se "
"engaden ao historial nen se almacenan cookies novas, non se pode acceder ás "
"cookies actuais, non se almacenan as iconas dos sitios, a sesión non se "
"grava e as procuras non se engaden ao menú emerxente da caixa de procuras de "
"Google. Até que feche a xanela pode premer os botóns Atrás e Adiante para "
"volver ás páxinas web que ten abertas.</p>"

#: mainwindow.cpp:795
msgid ""
"The web inspector will only work correctly for pages that were loaded after "
